Subject: adbd_auth: read authorized keys from /etc/adbd/adb_keys on Linux

The Android paths (/adb_keys, /data/misc/adb/adb_keys) do not fit a normal
Linux filesystem layout. ThinkSmart View image (lenovo-8), not upstream.

